import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Maintenance">
  <h1>Maintenance</h1>
  <p>This section collects the recurring service plan, fluid references, tire information, and owner maintenance records for the 2021 S60 T5 Inscription AWD.</p>
  <h2>Maintenance pages</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="../maintenance/service-schedule/">Service schedule</a></li>
    <li><a href="../maintenance/fluids/">Fluids and capacities</a></li>
    <li><a href="../maintenance/tires-wheels/">Tires and wheels</a></li>
    <li><a href="../maintenance/log/">Maintenance and repair log</a></li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Record every service</h2>
  <p>Keep the date, odometer, work performed, parts and fluid specifications, invoice, and next due point. For AWD-related work, record the component serviced and the exact fluid specification.</p>
  <div class="note">Use the vehicle's VIN-specific maintenance schedule and labels. Similar model years, engines, and option packages may use different parts or procedures.</div>
</BaseLayout>
